><div class="margin-top margin-small"><div class="blog_author-wrapper"><div class="blog_author-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68a48e5a6b74c275276a3f5d/68b6b13e78cdcf0df06a16f5_Micha.jpeg" alt="" class="blog_author-image"></div><div class="blog_author_text-wrapper"><div class="blog_author-text"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-semibold text-color-secondary">Micha Rave</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">CEO and Co-Founder </div></div><div class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Aug 17, 2025</div></div></div></div></div></a><link rel="prefetch" href="/blog/vaults-are-done-this-train-has-left-the-station">]]></content>
